<title>Sudan's civil war: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/sudan/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-sudan-2026-11-10T18:01:23.604Z</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 10 Nov 2026 18:01:23 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;The Sudanese army has secured Bakori and Sali, repelled attacks in the Blue Nile and advanced in West Kordofan, while the Rapid Support Forces (RSF) have carried out drone strikes that killed civilians in Blue Nile and White Nile states and caused a two-week power blackout that raised prices. A senior RSF commander has defected to the Sudanese army after 13 years, and Pakistan has signed a 1.5 billion-dollar security cooperation deal with Sudan. Drones now account for two thirds of child casualties, and Darfur faces looming famine as crop failures worsen humanitarian access. 4,680 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihgFBVV95cUxOQmNuUC01MzVjeTBMQjlLZjRORUdLTThVcERuZGxyRFRiQXp1LVhScEVRaVpXVUM2UWM1NC1nN0ZmazJSc2h4Mmc5ZjRldS04MXg4RS1WTER0cnN2QURZb19JWE9LYzcwYXZ6UlMxWmh0U19IR0owN1Q5Tm00TEI3ZG51Z19UZw?oc=5&quot;&gt;ReliefWeb&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiV0FVX3lxTE9uaDkyQ3k5RURDdWRTQ25OeW5CdTByclJpck5USTl0czFROFhkT3h5NTh4VW84VEs1cHJUamxVaEdlZEhxNFlzVnpsMXJZRS1nd21GclhlQQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihAFBVV95cUxQV1dFT1YwMFRzN0hoMHVfQ2tTakU1bnc2ZEFSdGV4WWIyN283dEZoLXVVTVNCMm1CaXg1bFZkSngtYy1IS2xBRkJjT0ZtN2hHLWI0Tm5CTmp6YkhGd1ZqOGhpZnh5S2tvNlR4TWpBMlpxamM4QWw3bXV5cnljb2ItUUJlMk4?oc=5&quot;&gt;ReliefWeb&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitwFBVV95cUxOQ3NGMmJlR0lfSEJmbmktSDdwQzI3VV9KZmpBbWZ6c3g4WTRlNHY5NElSUmw3TzdtWExLNTNMUVF4am5fMmhtdDVRbTNaZFRaOGN5dkJGbDdSaF9UM0F6dnVNendaZUg5S0NjWGF1SlltRGZBM1JIcXJlY1NhcmNnRWFyMVo0Ry1vWWU0V3FOQW9BOUpFem5ZZmtWUFVrdlU2UWFYdEplSFIzLUpPZWs4UEJGRzJ4dW_SAbwBQVVfeXFMUDVkMjJOMFQ0cVNZc3RaTHFnOFRuT1BhSzg0elhTdWRGelVCczNHOTU3RGNnLVBBS3Q0MDFtM2EzR0g3R2JIVkRFWnAwQTVIRVlzMWplQ2ozNGNrLXVDRnh3SG